                                                <div>
                                                    <p class="vertical-space">
                                                        <span class="bold-text">For your well-being:</span>
                                                    </p>
                                                    <p>
                                                        Overall, achieving well-being from a DISC perspective involves
                                                        honoring the unique strengths and challenges of each personality
                                                        style, while also fostering collaboration, understanding, and
                                                        mutual respect among individuals with different preferences and
                                                        priorities. By embracing diversity and leveraging the
                                                        complementary nature of different DISC styles, individuals and
                                                        teams can cultivate a culture of well-being and resilience in
                                                        both their personal and professional lives.
                                                    </p>
                                                    <p class="top-extra-space">
                                                        To enhance the well-being of an Influence/Steadiness (I/S) DISC
                                                        style individual, consider the following strategies:
                                                    <ul>
                                                        <li class="list-item">
                                                            Work-Life Balance: Encourage them to maintain a healthy
                                                            balance between work and personal life. Help them establish
                                                            boundaries, prioritize self-care activities, and allocate
                                                            time for relaxation, hobbies, and spending quality time with
                                                            family and friends.
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li class="list-item">
                                                            Stress Management Techniques: Teach them stress management
                                                            techniques to cope with workplace pressures and challenges
                                                            effectively. Encourage practices such as mindfulness, deep
                                                            breathing exercises, meditation, and regular physical
                                                            activity to reduce stress and promote emotional well-being.
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li class="list-item">
                                                            Positive Relationships: Foster positive relationships and a
                                                            supportive work environment where they feel valued,
                                                            appreciated, and connected to their colleagues. Encourage
                                                            teamwork, collaboration, and open communication to cultivate
                                                            a sense of belonging and camaraderie.
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li class="list-item">
                                                            Recognition and Appreciation: Recognize their contributions
                                                            and achievements regularly to boost their morale and
                                                            motivation. Provide positive feedback, praise their efforts,
                                                            and celebrate their successes to reinforce their sense of
                                                            accomplishment and worth.
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li class="list-item">
                                                            Clear Expectations: Ensure they have clear expectations and
                                                            understanding of their roles, responsibilities, and
                                                            performance objectives. Clarify goals, provide guidance and
                                                            support, and offer opportunities for skill development and
                                                            career advancement to foster a sense of purpose and
                                                            fulfillment.
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li class="list-item">
                                                            Autonomy and Flexibility: Empower them with autonomy and
                                                            flexibility in how they manage their work and schedule.
                                                            Allow them to work in ways that best suit their preferences
                                                            and strengths, such as flexible hours, remote work options,
                                                            or creative freedom in project execution.
                                                        </li>
                                                        <li class="list-item">
                                                            Meaningful Work: Help them find meaning and purpose in their
                                                            work by aligning tasks and projects with their values,
                                                            interests, and strengths. Assign projects that allow them to
                                                            make a positive impact, contribute to meaningful causes, or
