                                                                                Steadiness/Conscientiousness (SC) hybrid
                                                                                DISC style combines the traits of both
                                                                                Steadiness (S) and Conscientiousness (C)
                                                                                styles, resulting in a unique approach
                                                                                to communication.
                                                                            </p>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                                Here are some key characteristics of the
                                                                                communication style for individuals with
