                                                                                    communicators are patient listeners
                                                                                    who prefer to take their time to
                                                                                    process information thoroughly
                                                                                    before responding. They exhibit a
                                                                                    methodical approach to
                                                                                    communication, ensuring that their
                                                                                    messages are well-thought-out and
                                                                                    accurate.
