                                                                                    to convey information in a
                                                                                    straightforward manner, avoiding
                                                                                    unnecessary details or tangents that
                                                                                    may detract from the main point.
                                                                                </li>
                                                                                <li class="list-item">
                                                                                    Set Communication Goals: SC
                                                                                    communicators can set specific
                                                                                    communication goals for themselves,
