                                                                                <li class="list-item">
                                                                                    Manage Perfectionism: SC
                                                                                    communicators should be mindful of
                                                                                    perfectionistic tendencies that may
                                                                                    hinder their communication
                                                                                    effectiveness. They should strive
                                                                                    for excellence without becoming
                                                                                    overly fixated on minor details or
                                                                                    expecting flawless outcomes in every
                                                                                    communication interaction.
                                                                                </li>
                                                                                <li class="list-item">
