                                                                        <div>
                                                                            <p class="vertical-space">
                                                                                <span class="bold-text">Your conflict
                                                                                    style:</span>
                                                                            </p>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                                The conflict style of a
                                                                                Steadiness/Conscientiousness (SC) hybrid
                                                                                DISC style individual is characterized
                                                                                by a preference for avoiding conflict
                                                                                whenever possible, combined with a focus
                                                                                on maintaining fairness and adherence to
                                                                                established rules and standards.
                                                                            </p>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                                Here's a breakdown of their conflict
                                                                                style:
                                                                            <ul>
                                                                                <li class="list-item">
                                                                                    Avoidance: Individuals with a
                                                                                    Steadiness/Conscientiousness hybrid
                                                                                    style tend to avoid conflict and
                                                                                    confrontation, preferring to
                                                                                    maintain harmony and peace within
                                                                                    the team. They may hesitate to
                                                                                    express their concerns or opinions
                                                                                    openly, fearing that it could lead
                                                                                    to tension or disruption.
                                                                                </li>
                                                                                <li class="list-item">
                                                                                    Analytical Approach: When faced with
                                                                                    conflict, individuals with this
                                                                                    hybrid style may take an analytical
                                                                                    approach, carefully examining the
                                                                                    situation and considering all
                                                                                    relevant factors before responding.
                                                                                    They value accuracy and precision,
                                                                                    seeking to understand the root
                                                                                    causes of the conflict and identify
                                                                                    potential solutions based on logical
                                                                                    reasoning.
                                                                                </li>
                                                                                <li class="list-item">
                                                                                    Preference for Diplomacy:
                                                                                    Individuals with a
                                                                                    Steadiness/Conscientiousness hybrid
                                                                                    style often prefer to resolve
                                                                                    conflicts through diplomatic means,
                                                                                    such as negotiation or compromise.
                                                                                    They strive to find mutually
                                                                                    beneficial solutions that address
                                                                                    the needs and concerns of all
                                                                                    parties involved, without
                                                                                    sacrificing their principles or
                                                                                    compromising on important values.
                                                                                </li>
                                                                                <li class="list-item">
                                                                                    Emphasis on Fairness: Fairness and
                                                                                    equity are essential principles for
                                                                                    individuals with this hybrid style
                                                                                    when addressing conflict. They are
                                                                                    committed to upholding rules,
                                                                                    procedures, and ethical standards,
                                                                                    ensuring that any resolutions are
                                                                                    consistent with these guidelines.
                                                                                    They may advocate for transparency
                                                                                    and accountability in conflict
                                                                                    resolution processes, seeking to
                                                                                    maintain trust and integrity within
                                                                                    the team.
                                                                                </li>
                                                                                <li class="list-item">
                                                                                    Caution in Decision-Making: In
                                                                                    conflict situations, individuals
                                                                                    with a Steadiness/Conscientiousness
                                                                                    hybrid style may exhibit caution and
                                                                                    deliberation in their
                                                                                    decision-making process. They take
                                                                                    their time to weigh the potential
                                                                                    consequences of their actions and
                                                                                    consider alternative courses of
                                                                                    action before making a final
                                                                                    decision. Their thorough approach
                                                                                    reflects their commitment to making
                                                                                    well-informed choices that align
                                                                                    with their values and objectives.
                                                                                </li>
                                                                            </ul>
                                                                            Overall, individuals with a
                                                                            Steadiness/Conscientiousness hybrid DISC
                                                                            style approach conflict with a blend of
                                                                            diplomacy, analytical thinking, and a focus
                                                                            on fairness and adherence to rules.While
                                                                            they may prefer to avoid conflict whenever
                                                                            possible, they are capable of addressing
                                                                            conflicts effectively and finding
                                                                            constructive solutions that promote harmony
                                                                            and mutual respect within the team.
                                                                            </p>
                                                                        </div>
                                                                        <div>
