                                                                                Steadiness/Conscientiousness (SC) hybrid
                                                                                DISC style individual involves
                                                                                developing strategies to address
                                                                                conflict more assertively and
                                                                                effectively while still maintaining
                                                                                their commitment to harmony and
                                                                                fairness.
                                                                            </p>
