                                                                                    maintain harmony, accommodate the
                                                                                    needs of others, seek common ground,
                                                                                    approach conflict deliberately,
                                                                                    express concerns indirectly,
                                                                                    emphasize diplomacy, and focus on
                                                                                    problem-solving.
