                                                                                                    <p>
                                                                                                        Balancing your
                                                                                                        DISC style
                                                                                                        refers to the
                                                                                                        process of
                                                                                                        recognizing and
                                                                                                        managing the
                                                                                                        strengths and
                                                                                                        weaknesses
                                                                                                        associated with
                                                                                                        your dominant
