                                                                                                        achieve optimal
                                                                                                        outcomes in
                                                                                                        various
                                                                                                        situations. It
                                                                                                        involves
                                                                                                        understanding
                                                                                                        how your natural
                                                                                                        tendencies and
                                                                                                        preferences
                                                                                                        may influence
                                                                                                        your behavior
                                                                                                        and interactions
                                                                                                        with others, and
                                                                                                        consciously
                                                                                                        adapting your
                                                                                                        approach to suit
                                                                                                        the needs of the
                                                                                                        situation or the
                                                                                                        people involved.
                                                                                                    </p>
