                                                                                                        fundamentally
                                                                                                        but rather about
                                                                                                        leveraging your
                                                                                                        strengths while
                                                                                                        also
                                                                                                        being mindful of
                                                                                                        your limitations
                                                                                                        and adapting
                                                                                                        your behavior to
                                                                                                        meet
                                                                                                        the demands of
                                                                                                        different
                                                                                                        situations
                                                                                                        effectively. It
                                                                                                        requires
                                                                                                        self-awareness,
                                                                                                        flexibility, and
                                                                                                        the willingness
                                                                                                        to step outside
                                                                                                        your comfort
                                                                                                        zone when
                                                                                                        necessary to
                                                                                                        achieve better
                                                                                                        outcomes in
                                                                                                        personal and
                                                                                                        professional
                                                                                                        interactions.
                                                                                                    </p>
