                                                                                                            spend too
                                                                                                            much time
                                                                                                            gathering
                                                                                                            information
                                                                                                            or
                                                                                                            weighing
                                                                                                            options,
                                                                                                            which can
                                                                                                            delay
                                                                                                            decision-making
                                                                                                            and impede
                                                                                                            progress.
                                                                                                        </li>
                                                                                                        <li
                                                                                                            class="list-item">
                                                                                                            Micromanagement:
                                                                                                            Individuals
                                                                                                            who overuse
                                                                                                            the
                                                                                                            Conscientiousness
                                                                                                            style may
                                                                                                            have a
                                                                                                            tendency to
                                                                                                            micromanage
                                                                                                            tasks and
                                                                                                            control
                                                                                                            every aspect
                                                                                                            of a
                                                                                                            project.
                                                                                                            They may
                                                                                                            struggle to
                                                                                                            delegate
                                                                                                            responsibilities
