                                                                                                            others to
                                                                                                            complete
                                                                                                            tasks
                                                                                                            independently,
                                                                                                            which can
                                                                                                            undermine
                                                                                                            team
                                                                                                            morale and
                                                                                                            autonomy.
                                                                                                        </li>
                                                                                                        <li
                                                                                                            class="list-item">
                                                                                                            Overemphasis
                                                                                                            on rules and
                                                                                                            procedures:
                                                                                                            Overusers of
                                                                                                            the
                                                                                                            Conscientiousness
                                                                                                            style may
                                                                                                            prioritize
                                                                                                            adherence to
                                                                                                            rules
                                                                                                            and
                                                                                                            procedures
                                                                                                            over
                                                                                                            practicality
                                                                                                            or
                                                                                                            efficiency.
